{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご卒業おめでとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずっと尊敬していて、ずっと大好きでした"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobcEIoia.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobqbdHOJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobFFeyfz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7ZQiBf.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobtbEsTh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一緒にUDAGAWA GENERATIONのリハーサルをみた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobLpQZiQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんはセリフを間違えない"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXDuFTt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "じゃんけんをして、後輩が食べやすいようにしてくれる"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobZJLyH1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "シリアスなシーンでツボる"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobK8FPKx.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "追いかけ回して呆れられていた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobu9bkf1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんは一生いてくださいね　と言った"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobze9uES.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "振り入れの時は、みんなについていくために唯衣ちゃんの斜め後ろを確保（勝手にお手本）"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対ばれてない"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob2OJaLu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海外でお腹を空かせていたら「ゆづどれ食べたいの？」と呼んでお店でおにぎりを選ばせてくれる"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJA4aFc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まるで上手く喋れたかのように思わせてくれる（喋れていない）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobmQSmN0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJUb86i.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrqI08f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんはいくつも先のことまで見えている"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobmWYS9Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "個性的な柄で被る"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobXiQj9P.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "浮かれているため、肉の看板に驚く"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobw09yhX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全てゆづのせい、という謎のくだり"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob5RHub7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか、あんまり変わってないかも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "変わってるけど"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobw1xPr2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めての、先輩との二人仕事"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも助けてくださりありがとうございました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob9bNsmJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "側にいられて幸せでした！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobcM85Gr.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きな唯衣ちゃんへ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆづより"}], "source": "official"}